                    </Fill>
                </TextStylePaint>
                <TextValueRun styleId="744950:17" text="STORY: first the parchment: a stack of coins, medals and good deeds is held up and slides off; a plain open hand, palm up, and a gold light is laid in it (`hand`). Then a warm desert camp of cardboard tents under a peach sky; scarlet paper snakes in the sand (`desert`). The bronze serpent rises on its pole (`pole`). A grey figure starts to climb the pole, straining, comic, legs wrapped round it (`harder`), then stops, slides down, turns and simply looks up; close on their face as colour returns to it (`climb`)." name="brief" id="744950:20"/>
            </Text>
